### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api


### ============================================================
### PRODUCT ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================


### ============================================================
### Create Product
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/createProduct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Premium Cotton Shirts",
  "slug": "premium-cotton-shirts-formal",
  "description": "High quality cotton",
  "categoryId": "66cc113e-f19e-42df-bbff-777c21f7743a",
  "subCategoryId": "d9b1686a-ca9e-4f85-ab50-c719406f2a9f",
  "basePrice": 999.99,
  "discountPercentage": 10,
  "attributes": {
    "fabric": "Cotton",
    "work": "Plain",
    "sleeve": "Full"
  },
  "isFeatured": true,
  "active": true
}

### Sizes live in their own table — see productVariantAPI.rest

